1
00:00:03,220 --> 00:00:07,246
♪By red walls and a dry well,
my crown gathers dust and frost♪

2
00:00:07,643 --> 00:00:11,859
♪With a hoe and a patch of wasteland,
I sow the moonlight♪

3
00:00:11,903 --> 00:00:16,117
♪Who says the Cold Palace
holds nothing but tears?♪

4
00:00:16,308 --> 00:00:20,328
♪I choose to fill it with fragrant wine♪

5
00:00:20,666 --> 00:00:22,199
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

6
00:00:22,245 --> 00:00:24,733
♪Growing life's simple joys♪

7
00:00:24,799 --> 00:00:26,880
♪Bins full of grain, jars full of wine♪

8
00:00:26,971 --> 00:00:28,757
♪Better than dancing in silks♪

9
00:00:29,424 --> 00:00:30,650
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

10
00:00:30,927 --> 00:00:33,321
♪My heart longs for the world beyond♪

11
00:00:33,687 --> 00:00:35,800
♪Tending a courtyard full of life♪

12
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:40,560
♪Come, share a cup with me♪

13
00:00:40,560 --> 00:00:42,560
(Welcome to Cold Palace Refreshments)

14
00:00:45,716 --> 00:00:47,043
=Farm Busily in the Cold Palace=

15
00:00:47,043 --> 00:00:48,618
(Based on Hongshu.com's novel
I'm Busy Farming in the Cold Palace)

16
00:00:48,618 --> 00:00:49,649
=Episode 3=

17
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:52,079
Raise your head

18
00:00:52,719 --> 00:00:53,600
or lose it.

19
00:01:02,119 --> 00:01:03,399
(Your Majesty.)

20
00:01:03,479 --> 00:01:04,920
(The Empress Dowager summons you)

21
00:01:04,920 --> 00:01:08,519
(Consort Yao, and Consort Lan
to Ningxin Palace.)

22
00:01:15,640 --> 00:01:16,959
Take him to Shuxin Hall.

23
00:01:17,359 --> 00:01:18,599
Keep a close watch on him.

24
00:01:19,280 --> 00:01:20,239
When I return,

25
00:01:20,879 --> 00:01:22,599
I'll deal with him myself.

26
00:01:22,840 --> 00:01:23,640
(Yes, Your Majesty.)

27
00:01:27,840 --> 00:01:29,799
The rest of you may leave.

28
00:01:38,760 --> 00:01:40,280
Greetings, Mother.

29
00:01:40,959 --> 00:01:43,159
- Greetings, Your Majesty.
- Greetings, Your Majesty.

30
00:01:43,963 --> 00:01:46,823
(Empress Dowager)

31
00:01:46,879 --> 00:01:47,920
Be seated.

32
00:01:54,879 --> 00:01:57,719
Mother, why the urgent summons?

33
00:01:58,120 --> 00:01:59,760
It's nothing urgent.

34
00:01:59,959 --> 00:02:01,560
I was simply thinking of you.

35
00:02:02,239 --> 00:02:04,400
Then a servant mentioned

36
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:06,120
that Consort Yao and
Consort Lan were there too.

37
00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:08,759
I thought we could enjoy some company.

38
00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:12,199
If you like having company, Aunt,

39
00:02:12,199 --> 00:02:13,639
I'll visit every day.

40
00:02:14,240 --> 00:02:15,680
I hear

41
00:02:15,680 --> 00:02:17,319
you received a lavish reward recently.

42
00:02:18,039 --> 00:02:19,919
What sort of lotus wine

43
00:02:19,919 --> 00:02:21,960
pleased His Majesty so?

44
00:02:22,199 --> 00:02:24,520
You might have brought me some.

45
00:02:24,520 --> 00:02:25,680
I rewarded the wrong person.

46
00:02:25,759 --> 00:02:27,800
She didn't brew it.

47
00:02:28,039 --> 00:02:30,000
Heaven and earth can attest

48
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:31,080
to my devotion to Your Majesty.

49
00:02:31,879 --> 00:02:33,960
I may not have brewed it,

50
00:02:34,080 --> 00:02:36,439
but I went to great lengths
to obtain the recipe.

51
00:02:36,439 --> 00:02:38,000
That greedy little eunuch

52
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:39,560
demanded 50,000 taels of silver!

53
00:02:39,840 --> 00:02:41,080
Fifty thousand?

54
00:02:41,719 --> 00:02:43,879
Just for a wine recipe?

55
00:02:44,840 --> 00:02:46,960
That's months of tax from a whole city!

56
00:02:47,520 --> 00:02:48,759
Consort Yao,

57
00:02:48,759 --> 00:02:50,240
how could you be so extravagant?

58
00:02:50,240 --> 00:02:51,599
I never paid him.

59
00:02:51,599 --> 00:02:52,439
I got it for free.

60
00:02:52,840 --> 00:02:55,000
That eunuch wouldn't dare complain.

61
00:02:56,400 --> 00:02:57,719
You're an imperial consort,

62
00:02:58,400 --> 00:03:00,520
yet you cheat a lowly eunuch?

63
00:03:01,159 --> 00:03:03,240
What about the dignity
of the imperial family?

64
00:03:04,560 --> 00:03:05,240
Your fault!

65
00:03:05,599 --> 00:03:07,639
If you hadn't bid against me,

66
00:03:07,759 --> 00:03:08,800
a hundred taels would've been enough!

67
00:03:09,120 --> 00:03:10,800
That's unfair.

68
00:03:11,039 --> 00:03:13,120
You wished to please His Majesty.

69
00:03:13,439 --> 00:03:14,719
Naturally,

70
00:03:14,719 --> 00:03:17,240
I hoped to catch his eye too.

71
00:03:17,439 --> 00:03:18,039
You...

72
00:03:19,400 --> 00:03:20,400
(Oh, no.)

73
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:21,879
(I still owe her a hundred taels.)

74
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:27,599
Since Consort Yao
and Consort Lan arrived,

75
00:03:27,759 --> 00:03:29,960
you've never summoned either one.

76
00:03:30,360 --> 00:03:31,759
I know

77
00:03:31,759 --> 00:03:33,800
affairs of state keep you occupied

78
00:03:33,800 --> 00:03:35,159
from morning till night.

79
00:03:35,159 --> 00:03:37,000
But producing heirs

80
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:39,039
is also a matter of state.

81
00:03:39,360 --> 00:03:40,360
Mother.

82
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:43,599
I believe procreation
is an animal instinct.

83
00:03:44,439 --> 00:03:47,680
True happiness comes
from a loving union.

84
00:03:48,560 --> 00:03:49,319
Oh?

85
00:03:49,960 --> 00:03:53,439
Is there someone you love, then?

86
00:03:58,240 --> 00:04:00,800
Eunuch Cao.

87
00:04:00,800 --> 00:04:05,719
I'm absolutely starving.

88
00:04:05,919 --> 00:04:06,520
Please.

89
00:04:06,520 --> 00:04:08,439
Have a heart.

90
00:04:14,719 --> 00:04:16,000
That's it?

91
00:04:16,519 --> 00:04:19,800
Where's my imperial banquet?

92
00:04:19,800 --> 00:04:21,839
Be grateful you have food at all.

93
00:04:21,839 --> 00:04:24,040
Stop being so picky.

94
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:30,600
I'm just

95
00:04:31,879 --> 00:04:33,839
so touched.

96
00:04:35,079 --> 00:04:36,720
There's something you
don't know, Eunuch Cao.

97
00:04:37,279 --> 00:04:39,959
I was sold here as a child,

98
00:04:40,480 --> 00:04:41,680
all alone in the world,

99
00:04:42,360 --> 00:04:44,000
bullied by everyone.

100
00:04:45,480 --> 00:04:47,920
I've never had a proper meal.

101
00:04:49,680 --> 00:04:52,120
You're so kind to me.

102
00:04:52,920 --> 00:04:54,920
You're like a second parent to me.

103
00:04:55,040 --> 00:04:58,240
Plain porridge is wonderful too.

104
00:05:06,639 --> 00:05:08,120
Wait here. Just wait.

105
00:05:16,399 --> 00:05:17,000
Your Majesty.

106
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:17,920
What's that smell?

107
00:05:18,279 --> 00:05:19,959
Roast duck and braised pork hock.

108
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:20,839
Xiao Lu

109
00:05:20,839 --> 00:05:22,120
kept asking for them.

110
00:05:22,120 --> 00:05:24,399
I felt sorry for him.

111
00:05:25,360 --> 00:05:26,199
Where is he?

112
00:05:26,759 --> 00:05:27,879
Right over...

113
00:05:31,839 --> 00:05:32,879
Oh, heavens!

114
00:05:32,879 --> 00:05:35,079
That little brat tricked me!

115
00:05:35,480 --> 00:05:37,480
He ate his fill and ran off!

116
00:05:37,959 --> 00:05:39,000
Trying to run again?

117
00:05:40,399 --> 00:05:42,079
You won't get away so easily this time.

118
00:05:42,360 --> 00:05:44,639
Want to settle the score?

119
00:05:44,680 --> 00:05:45,839
In your dreams.

120
00:05:46,240 --> 00:05:47,879
It was a fake identity anyway.

121
00:05:48,360 --> 00:05:49,439
Good luck finding me.

122
00:06:08,519 --> 00:06:09,519
It's you!

123
00:06:10,720 --> 00:06:11,920
I knew it was you.

124
00:06:14,800 --> 00:06:15,720
Come here!

125
00:06:18,759 --> 00:06:19,519
Shh!

126
00:06:28,160 --> 00:06:29,639
His Majesty has retired.

127
00:06:29,639 --> 00:06:31,839
Keep your distance and make no noise.

128
00:06:31,839 --> 00:06:32,959
Leave now.

129
00:06:37,360 --> 00:06:38,439
So what if he's the Emperor?

130
00:06:38,720 --> 00:06:39,920
Ugly people are always such a pain.

131
00:06:39,959 --> 00:06:41,959
Making trouble in
the middle of the night.

132
00:06:43,040 --> 00:06:44,480
Do you hate him that much?

133
00:06:44,759 --> 00:06:45,920
Not really.

134
00:06:46,399 --> 00:06:48,800
We have nothing to do with each other.

135
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:51,519
He's just too ugly for my taste.

136
00:06:53,279 --> 00:06:55,000
What if he weren't ugly?

137
00:06:56,480 --> 00:06:58,560
I've seen him myself.

138
00:06:58,639 --> 00:07:00,240
He looks like a walnut.

139
00:07:00,399 --> 00:07:01,839
Flat nose, tiny eyes.

140
00:07:01,839 --> 00:07:02,639
And get this...

141
00:07:02,920 --> 00:07:04,399
A chili dangling from a big tree.

142
00:07:06,319 --> 00:07:08,360
A chili dangling from a big tree.

143
00:07:10,240 --> 00:07:11,399
A big tree.

144
00:07:12,279 --> 00:07:13,120
A chili.

145
00:07:14,120 --> 00:07:14,920
You...

146
00:07:15,800 --> 00:07:16,959
How can a young lady

147
00:07:16,959 --> 00:07:18,439
say such outrageous things?

148
00:07:18,759 --> 00:07:19,879
So what if I'm a lady?

149
00:07:19,879 --> 00:07:21,439
I'm just telling the truth.

150
00:07:23,160 --> 00:07:25,240
Did you rat me out?

151
00:07:25,240 --> 00:07:26,240
His Majesty's after me.

152
00:07:26,319 --> 00:07:27,480
What would I even rat you out for?

153
00:07:27,480 --> 00:07:28,759
The erotic painting.

154
00:07:29,240 --> 00:07:30,279
The erotic painting?

155
00:07:31,000 --> 00:07:31,399
Hah.

156
00:07:32,360 --> 00:07:34,040
I don't even know who you are.

157
00:07:34,480 --> 00:07:35,639
How could I report you?

158
00:07:36,240 --> 00:07:37,040
(Fair point.)

159
00:07:37,319 --> 00:07:38,680
(When His Majesty came to see me,)

160
00:07:38,680 --> 00:07:40,319
(he never mentioned the painting.)

161
00:07:40,720 --> 00:07:42,959
(Was it just my guilty conscience?)

162
00:07:45,879 --> 00:07:46,720
Oh!

163
00:07:46,959 --> 00:07:48,519
A misunderstanding.

164
00:07:49,480 --> 00:07:50,360
Hey, handsome.

165
00:07:50,600 --> 00:07:52,399
I can tell

166
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:54,600
you're a very forgiving man.

167
00:07:55,639 --> 00:07:56,240
Hmph.

168
00:07:57,399 --> 00:07:57,879
Well,

169
00:07:57,879 --> 00:07:59,160
you've got me all wrong.

170
00:07:59,720 --> 00:08:00,639
I'm the kind of person

171
00:08:01,160 --> 00:08:02,480
who never lets a grudge go.

172
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:04,879
I'm petty to the core.

173
00:08:11,519 --> 00:08:14,040
(In my last life,)

174
00:08:14,519 --> 00:08:16,040
(I spent every day working with crops.)

175
00:08:16,600 --> 00:08:17,759
(But in this life,)

176
00:08:17,759 --> 00:08:19,959
(I finally get some eye candy.)

177
00:08:25,040 --> 00:08:25,839
You...

178
00:08:26,319 --> 00:08:27,519
Who exactly are you?

179
00:08:28,120 --> 00:08:29,600
How can you wander around

180
00:08:30,279 --> 00:08:32,360
the Emperor's bedchamber?

181
00:08:32,480 --> 00:08:33,879
Who would you like me to be?

182
00:08:37,759 --> 00:08:39,039
You?

183
00:08:39,039 --> 00:08:39,879
A guard,

184
00:08:39,879 --> 00:08:40,679
a high official,

185
00:08:40,679 --> 00:08:42,279
or a member of the royal family.

186
00:08:42,919 --> 00:08:45,080
(Anything but the Emperor?)

187
00:08:45,360 --> 00:08:46,399
I... I am...

188
00:08:50,799 --> 00:08:52,200
His Majesty's uncle.

189
00:08:52,720 --> 00:08:54,120
You may call me

190
00:08:54,360 --> 00:08:55,159
Prince Chen.

191
00:08:55,360 --> 00:08:56,159
Oh.

192
00:08:57,360 --> 00:08:58,679
Prince Chen?

193
00:09:00,440 --> 00:09:01,679
(I vaguely remember him)

194
00:09:01,679 --> 00:09:03,200
(from the original Lu
Yunluo's memories.)

195
00:09:03,559 --> 00:09:05,279
(They were even betrothed.)

196
00:09:05,600 --> 00:09:07,720
(Then that cunning Emperor
swooped in and stole her away.)

197
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:10,279
(Poor guy.)

198
00:09:10,320 --> 00:09:11,639
(What terrible luck.)

199
00:09:13,320 --> 00:09:14,840
Why are you looking at me like that?

200
00:09:16,720 --> 00:09:17,600
Because

201
00:09:18,159 --> 00:09:19,519
you're so handsome.

202
00:09:20,120 --> 00:09:21,080
Heh-heh.

203
00:09:24,320 --> 00:09:25,120
Well.

204
00:09:27,559 --> 00:09:28,799
You promised me

205
00:09:29,559 --> 00:09:31,080
that if we met again,

206
00:09:31,360 --> 00:09:32,759
you'd tell me who you are.

207
00:09:34,519 --> 00:09:35,679
Me?

208
00:09:36,519 --> 00:09:38,919
I'm a maid with the Well Recovery Office
in the Cold Palace.

209
00:09:39,440 --> 00:09:40,879
(So she works in the Cold Palace.)

210
00:09:41,600 --> 00:09:43,360
(No wonder I couldn't find her.)

211
00:09:44,759 --> 00:09:46,759
This Well Recovery Office...

212
00:09:47,840 --> 00:09:48,840
What is it?

213
00:09:49,559 --> 00:09:50,759
A prince like you

214
00:09:50,840 --> 00:09:52,080
wouldn't know, of course.

215
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:53,879
The Cold Palace

216
00:09:54,039 --> 00:09:56,120
has more than a Well Recovery Office.

217
00:09:56,679 --> 00:09:58,480
There's a Poisoned Wine Bureau,

218
00:09:58,759 --> 00:09:59,559
a Madhouse Workshop,

219
00:09:59,759 --> 00:10:00,840
a Delirium Records Office,

220
00:10:00,840 --> 00:10:01,879
and on and on.

221
00:10:03,039 --> 00:10:04,240
That place

222
00:10:04,600 --> 00:10:06,679
swallows people whole.

223
00:10:06,759 --> 00:10:07,639
So

224
00:10:08,120 --> 00:10:09,600
I'll make lots and lots of money

225
00:10:09,960 --> 00:10:10,759
and get out.

226
00:10:14,279 --> 00:10:15,559
You want to escape the palace?

227
00:10:15,559 --> 00:10:16,360
What else?

228
00:10:17,519 --> 00:10:18,279
Stay there

229
00:10:18,679 --> 00:10:19,759
until I die or go mad?

230
00:10:21,360 --> 00:10:22,360
What if I said

231
00:10:23,440 --> 00:10:25,759
I could provide for you
for the rest of your life?

232
00:10:31,159 --> 00:10:31,919
Wait.

233
00:10:32,960 --> 00:10:34,399
Have you fallen for me?

234
00:10:35,639 --> 00:10:36,559
What if I have?

235
00:10:38,279 --> 00:10:39,320
Cold Palace maid,

236
00:10:40,279 --> 00:10:42,919
will you stay by my side?

237
00:10:45,200 --> 00:10:46,320
If it's a rank you want,

238
00:10:47,799 --> 00:10:48,919
I can give you one.

239
00:10:49,600 --> 00:10:51,240
(I'm already the Empress.)

240
00:10:51,480 --> 00:10:52,919
(What good is a rank?)

241
00:10:53,360 --> 00:10:54,600
(The imperial family is heartless.)

242
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:56,399
(Every consort in the Cold Palace)

243
00:10:56,600 --> 00:10:58,360
(was once showered with favor.)

244
00:10:59,559 --> 00:11:00,600
Thank you, Your Highness.

245
00:11:01,480 --> 00:11:02,600
But that's not the life I want.

246
00:11:02,840 --> 00:11:04,320
I won't be a caged bird.

247
00:11:06,960 --> 00:11:07,879
What do you want?

248
00:11:09,559 --> 00:11:10,480
Beyond the city walls

249
00:11:10,960 --> 00:11:12,240
lies a vast and beautiful world.

250
00:11:12,919 --> 00:11:14,960
Fish leap freely in the boundless sea.

251
00:11:15,360 --> 00:11:17,120
Birds soar freely in the endless sky.

252
00:11:18,200 --> 00:11:19,000
Maybe we'll meet again.

253
00:11:22,720 --> 00:11:24,440
Well said: fish leap freely
in the boundless sea.

254
00:11:25,320 --> 00:11:27,000
Birds soar freely in the sky.

255
00:11:34,383 --> 00:11:34,990
Hmph.

256
00:11:35,240 --> 00:11:37,200
Selling palace property in secret?

257
00:11:37,679 --> 00:11:39,240
Do you know what this is?

258
00:11:39,960 --> 00:11:40,960
I don't.

259
00:11:41,320 --> 00:11:43,120
(Xiao Chengzi)
Please tell me, Chief Cao.

260
00:11:43,120 --> 00:11:44,720
You insolent fool!

261
00:11:45,279 --> 00:11:47,000
This is His Majesty's jade pendant!

262
00:11:48,039 --> 00:11:48,960
I deserve death!

263
00:11:49,159 --> 00:11:51,039
I didn't know it
belonged to His Majesty!

264
00:11:51,039 --> 00:11:52,399
Please spare me, Your Majesty!

265
00:11:52,440 --> 00:11:53,639
Where did you say

266
00:11:54,519 --> 00:11:56,200
you got this pendant?

267
00:11:58,000 --> 00:11:58,639
It was

268
00:11:58,840 --> 00:12:00,000
a maid from the Cold Palace

269
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:01,240
asked me to sell it.

270
00:12:01,759 --> 00:12:03,799
I asked her where it came from.

271
00:12:04,120 --> 00:12:06,720
She swore her master
had given it to her.

272
00:12:08,679 --> 00:12:09,720
Nonsense!

273
00:12:10,080 --> 00:12:12,159
His Majesty would never be so foolish

274
00:12:12,159 --> 00:12:15,120
as to give a personal possession
to a maid in the Cold Palace!

275
00:12:15,320 --> 00:12:16,039
She...

276
00:12:16,039 --> 00:12:17,519
She's no ordinary maid.

277
00:12:17,559 --> 00:12:18,600
She's...

278
00:12:18,600 --> 00:12:21,519
She's the personal maid to the Empress
in the Cold Palace.

279
00:12:24,559 --> 00:12:25,639
Who did you say

280
00:12:26,840 --> 00:12:27,840
that woman was?

281
00:12:28,399 --> 00:12:29,000
She's

282
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:29,679
the Em...

283
00:12:29,679 --> 00:12:31,320
The Empress's personal maid.

284
00:12:33,159 --> 00:12:34,360
(You've told me who you are.)

285
00:12:34,480 --> 00:12:35,639
(I'll be honest with you too.)

286
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:38,159
(I'm a maid with the Well
Recovery Office in the Cold Palace.)

287
00:12:40,559 --> 00:12:41,399
Don't follow me.

288
00:12:45,919 --> 00:12:48,639
Why is this wine making me so hot?

289
00:12:49,360 --> 00:12:51,840
My lady, no more wine.

290
00:12:52,240 --> 00:12:53,399
Put your clothes on.

291
00:12:53,639 --> 00:12:54,720
You'll catch a chill.

292
00:12:55,120 --> 00:12:57,039
I'm finally enjoying myself.

293
00:12:57,519 --> 00:12:59,559
We'll be out of here soon!

294
00:13:00,440 --> 00:13:02,080
The Cold Palace is so secluded.

295
00:13:02,200 --> 00:13:03,559
There aren't even any guards.

296
00:13:03,600 --> 00:13:05,320
If someone came in and saw you,

297
00:13:05,559 --> 00:13:06,879
your reputation would be ruined.

298
00:13:07,120 --> 00:13:08,919
Girls dress like this where I'm from.

299
00:13:09,559 --> 00:13:11,039
Guys with eight-pack abs

300
00:13:11,519 --> 00:13:13,159
are everywhere.

301
00:13:13,639 --> 00:13:17,320
You were just born in the wrong era.

302
00:13:17,600 --> 00:13:19,519
You're talking nonsense again.

303
00:13:19,600 --> 00:13:20,759
Let's get you inside to rest.

304
00:13:20,759 --> 00:13:21,519
No!

305
00:13:21,799 --> 00:13:22,480
I don't want to!

306
00:13:23,039 --> 00:13:24,240
Chancellor Lu's legitimate daughter.

307
00:13:25,320 --> 00:13:26,639
Lu Yunluo.

308
00:13:48,230 --> 00:13:52,256
♪By red walls and a dry well,
my crown gathers dust and frost♪

309
00:13:52,653 --> 00:13:56,869
♪With a hoe and a patch of wasteland,
I sow the moonlight♪

310
00:13:56,913 --> 00:14:01,127
♪Who says the Cold Palace
holds nothing but tears?♪

311
00:14:01,318 --> 00:14:05,338
♪I choose to fill it with fragrant wine♪

312
00:14:05,676 --> 00:14:09,743
♪Cool dew, starry nights,
wheat sprouts in my hands♪

313
00:14:09,809 --> 00:14:13,990
♪I shape fields, not painted brows,
and fill them with hope♪

314
00:14:14,434 --> 00:14:17,801
♪Gold and silver bloom from the soil♪

315
00:14:18,272 --> 00:14:22,952
♪I smile as the world storms on♪

316
00:14:24,609 --> 00:14:26,756
♪No finery to rival spring♪

317
00:14:26,936 --> 00:14:31,240
♪All I wish for are waves of green♪

318
00:14:33,650 --> 00:14:35,396
♪Where is beauty found?♪

319
00:14:35,577 --> 00:14:40,007
♪Just lift your eyes and see♪

320
00:14:40,574 --> 00:14:42,141
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

321
00:14:42,160 --> 00:14:44,629
♪Growing life's simple joys♪

322
00:14:44,695 --> 00:14:46,776
♪Bins full of grain, jars full of wine♪

323
00:14:46,940 --> 00:14:48,714
♪Better than dancing in silks♪

324
00:14:49,320 --> 00:14:50,586
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

325
00:14:50,823 --> 00:14:53,217
♪My heart longs for the world beyond♪

326
00:14:53,458 --> 00:14:55,758
♪Tending a courtyard full of life♪

327
00:14:56,036 --> 00:15:00,360
♪Come, share a cup with me♪
